  {
    "command": "set_background",
    "display_name": "恋恋飯店",
    "id": "1022",
    "timezone": "4"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「転校生、みんなの連絡先とか知ってるアルか？　ワタシは今日初めて会ったひとばかりだし、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「同じクラスで連絡網がある遠見ちゃんちの番号ぐらいしか知らないアル」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「とりあえず電話とかして、おうちのひとに迎えにきてもらうアル。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「無理やり叩き起こして歩いて帰らせるのは、可哀想アルし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「師父がいれば、車をだしてもらえたアルけどね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「まぁ場合によっては、泊まってってもらえばいいアルね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「明日は学校もお休みアルし、この店は裏に師父の拳法道場も併設してるアル。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「そこに布団を敷けば、大人数でも寝られるアル～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「転校生も、よかったら泊まってくといいアルよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「ウフフ、遠慮することないアル。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「女の子たちのなかに男の子ひとり、っていう状況は『いつもどおり』でしょ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「他の女の子はわからないアルけど、ワタシはいつも父と狭い部屋でふたりで寝てるアルからね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「たまにお店が忙しいときとか、道場で特訓するときとか、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「泊まりこんで師父と同じ布団で寝ることもアルあるし」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「男の子といっしょでも、ぐっすり眠れるアル♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「んん。むしろ、こういうのは『はしたない』アルかね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「この国の女の子たちは、奥ゆかしいアルからね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「ん？　何見てるアルか、転校生？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「あぁ、ワタシの私服が珍しいアルか。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「もう営業時間も終わったし、ちゃちゃっと着替えてきたアルよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「あとはお風呂入って寝るだけだし、ラフな格好で寛ぐアル～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「ウフフ。さすがに私服まで中華っぽくないアルよ、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「プライベートな時間まで『胡散臭い中国人』キャラをつくってられないアル」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「まぁでも、タグを見たらこれもメイド・イン・チャイナ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「こういう服とか、安い量販店でまとめ買いしたのを着てるアル。うちは貧乏アルからね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「あっ、転校生……座って休んでてほしいアル。あとは、ぜんぶワタシがやるアルよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「床をモップがけするのは拳法の修行にもなるアル、任せてほしいアル～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「アチョー！　ハイヤー！　ホアチャー！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「……おっと。みんな寝てるんだから、静かにしないといけないアルね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「でも、ワタシまだまだ元気いっぱいアル！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「みんなが手伝ってくれたアルから、いつもより楽ちんだったアルよ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「何だかとっても、気分もいいアル～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「ワタシ、最高に幸せ……☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「みんなとも、仲良くなれた気がする。転校生が繋げてくれた、縁だね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「どれだけ感謝しても足りないよ、ほんとにありがとう！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「もっともっと、いろんなひとと友達になりたいな。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「この国のひとたちと。ワタシの大好きな、優しいひとたちと……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「ワタシは不器用で、トンチンカンなことばっかりする。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「いろいろ間違っちゃうし、お馬鹿な失敗もする。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「だから、よかったら今後も手伝ってくれると嬉しいな」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「ううん。導いてくれると、助かっちゃうよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「あれ？　転校生も、寝ちゃった……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「なぁんだ。珍しく真面目に、ふつうに喋ったのになぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「まぁいいや。たくさん働いてくれたんだもん、そのぶんたっぷり休養をとらないとね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「さっさと布団を敷いて、みんなを運んで、寝かせてあげようっと」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「お疲れさま、ゆっくり休んでね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「起きたら、とびきりおいしい朝がゆでもご馳走するよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「……謝々♪」"
  }
]